								<h1 class="TextFourXL FontBoldElement TrackingTightElement TextGrayNineHundredElement SmallTextSixXL">A Thoughtful Beauty Salon Experience</h1>
								<p class="MarginTopSixElement TextLargeElement LeadingEightElement TextGraySixHundredElement">
									Welcome to Rose Quartz Salon, a beauty salon concept for people who want their visit to feel considered, comfortable, and personal. We believe a good salon experience begins with listening: understanding your preferences, discussing the options that may suit you, and making space for questions before you decide what you would like. Use this site to explore our approach to beauty and self-care, then contact the salon to ask about current services, availability, and
									location details. Every person and every preference is different, so we encourage clear communication rather than one-size-fits-all promises. Whether you are planning ahead or simply gathering information, Rose Quartz Salon is here to help you take the next step at your own pace.
								</p>
								<div class="MarginTopTenElement FlexElement ItemsCenterElement GapXSixElement">
