								<h2 class="TextGrayNineHundredElement TextLargeElement title-font FontMediumElement MarginBottomTwoElement">Start with a Conversation</h2>
								<p class="LeadingRelaxedElement TextBaseElement">
									A salon visit can feel easier when there is room to explain what you are looking for and ask questions before choosing a service. We value clear, respectful communication about preferences, expectations, and any details you would like the salon to know. If you are unsure which option may suit you, reach out to discuss what is currently available. Your choices remain yours, and taking time to gather information can help you make a more comfortable, informed decision.
								</p>
