								<h2 class="TextGrayNineHundredElement TextLargeElement title-font FontMediumElement MarginBottomTwoElement">Personal Preferences Matter</h2>
								<p class="LeadingRelaxedElement TextBaseElement">
									Beauty and self-care are individual, and the same look or experience will not be right for everyone. Rose Quartz Salon’s approach is to make space for your preferences and invite you to share what matters to you. You can ask questions, describe the kind of visit you have in mind, and discuss options before deciding how to proceed. We avoid treating personal style as a formula; instead, we encourage an open conversation that respects your comfort, choices, and
									expectations.
								</p>
