								<p class="LeadingRelaxedElement TextBaseElement">
									Useful information can make planning a salon visit more straightforward. Before booking, ask about the services currently offered, appointment availability, pricing, preparation, and any other practical details that are important to you. Because these details can change and have not been specified here, please confirm them directly with Rose Quartz Salon. Taking a moment to clarify the basics helps you understand your options and avoid relying on assumptions or
