							<div class="LargeWidthOneHalfElement">
								<h2 class="TextThreeXL FontBoldElement TrackingTightElement TextGrayNineHundredElement SmallTextFourXL">The Principles Behind Our Approach</h2>
								<p class="MarginTopSixElement TextLargeElement LeadingEightElement TextGraySixHundredElement">Rather than relying on unverified numbers or promises, this section highlights the ideas that can help shape a thoughtful beauty salon experience: communication, personal choice, useful information, and respect. These principles are a guide to the site’s tone, not measured business results or claims about a specific appointment.</p>
								<p class="MarginTopSixElement TextLargeElement LeadingEightElement TextGraySixHundredElement">
									Every salon visit begins with individual preferences, so a single statistic cannot describe what matters to every guest. We encourage you to ask about current services, pricing, availability, and other practical details directly. The numbered points below are simply a way to organize our approach; they do not represent customer totals, years in business, ratings, or guaranteed outcomes.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="LargeWidthOneHalfElement MarginTopTenElement LargeMarginTopZeroElement">
								<div class="GridElement GridColumnsTwoElement GapEightElement LargeGapTenElement">
